    refine ⟨φ (P w), hKF (P w), ?_, _root_.PositivityTheory.SiegelWeilFormula.Atop.genAt_k hG c hT hAux hFM hLo hLI hGS hGI hGD hPK hSK hEW d R w hΨ hφ hvac (P w)⟩
